  "description": "Command-line tool that converts OPC UA specification Word documents to NISO STS 1.2 Extended XML, validates an STS document's tables against its OPC UA NodeSet(s), and writes clause documentation links back into a NodeSet. Windows-only (drives Microsoft Word/Visio/PowerPoint/Excel via COM). Install with: dotnet tool install --global OPCFoundation.Opc.Ua.SpecificationValidator. Invoke as Opc.Ua.SpecificationValidator.",
